1
00:00:02,730 --> 00:00:14,060
In what situation was Vu A Dinh caught by the enemy?

2
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:27,970
Vu A Dinh was caught by the enemy on a liaison mission.

3
00:00:30,330 --> 00:00:39,040
What did the enemy make Vu A Dinh do?

4
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:48,350
A. Make A Dinh their henchman.

5
00:00:49,930 --> 00:00:58,350
B. Make A Dinh reveal where our weapons were hidden.

6
00:00:59,170 --> 00:01:08,710
C. Make A Dinh reveal the location of our cadres.

7
00:01:16,150 --> 00:01:32,110
Answer C: The enemy made A Dinh reveal the location of our cadres.

8
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:42,200
What did the enemy do when catching Vu A Dinh?

9
00:01:43,350 --> 00:02:00,950
A. Interrogated, beat, threatened A Dinh, forced him to reveal the location of our cadres.

10
00:02:02,460 --> 00:02:14,570
B. They beat A Dinh from early morning until noon, until late afternoon.

11
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:27,460
C. Made A Dinh lie outside in the cold wind, freezing dew.

12
00:02:28,350 --> 00:02:35,880
D. They released A Dinh the next morning.

13
00:02:41,480 --> 00:02:51,110
Answer A, B, C.

14
00:02:53,060 --> 00:02:59,930
Vu A Dinh's attitude and action before the enemy's brutal beating?

15
00:03:01,350 --> 00:03:06,710
A. Escape.

16
00:03:07,480 --> 00:03:12,640
B. Only answer "I don't know!".

17
00:03:13,640 --> 00:03:17,550
C. Say nothing.

18
00:03:18,200 --> 00:03:21,550
D. Grit teeth and endure.

19
00:03:25,660 --> 00:03:32,280
Answer B, C, D.

